e title reads \"三体文明\", flanked by small gold star ornaments; beneath it, a smaller pale subtitle reads \"来自半人马座α星系的文明\". Below the subtitle, a wide rounded rectangular introduction panel contains the full body text \"三体文明是刘慈欣科幻小说《三体》中描述的位于半人马座α星系的外星文明。该文明因生存环境极端恶劣而发展出独特的科技与文化，面对人类文明的崛起展现出理性、冷静与危机意识。其核心思想包括“黑暗森林法则”、“面壁者计划”以及“三日凌空”等，展现了宇宙社会学的深刻思考。\" in light gray-white Chinese characters. In the upper-left content area, a bordered card titled \"起源与背景\" includes the body text \"三体文明起源于半人马座α星系，围绕一颗不稳定的三恒星系统演化。由于恒星的剧烈变化，环境极端恶劣，生命形态独特，文明发展路径与地球截然不同。\" and a realistic illustration of three glowing stars in space with planets, dust, and orbital trails. To its right, a matching card titled \"社会结构\" contains \"三体文明具有高度集体主义和理性至上的社会特征。个体服从整体，决策基于长期生存概率，情感因素被极大抑制。社会以“智子”为核心科技体系组织生产与生活。\" beside a cool monochrome cityscape with towers, domes, elevated structures, and misty blue-gray lighting. In the middle-left area, another card titled \"核心科技\" presents \"三体文明掌握多种超越地球的科技：智子锁死技术、纳米材料、曲率驱动、维度打击等。其科技特点在于实用性与毁灭性并存，服务于文明的延续而非扩张。\" next to a circular technological diagram showing a central sphere surrounded by orbiting rings, nodes, radial lines, and faint technical markings. To the right, the card titled \"代表理论\" contains \"“黑暗森林法则”：宇宙中每个文明都是带枪的猎人，暴露自己就是自取灭亡。“面壁者计划”：为应对潜在威胁，三体人设立独立决策者，隐藏真实战略。“三日凌空”：太阳将同时从"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 75, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "d9c2072a2de5f51ef9898ec50ccd4dda82e16126", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAG